    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37145" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεπίσταμαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>know thoroughly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.93
			</span></i>: c. part., <i>know well that . .,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸν Κῦρον οὐκ ἀτρεμίζοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.190
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1584
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν θεὸν τοιοῦτον</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄντα</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					771
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i>know well how</i> to do, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				480
			</span></i>: with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				838
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					417
				</span></i>
			, etc.: c. acc. et inf.; <i>know that,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				293
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>know by heart,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					228b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
